---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | INVESThOuR"
  description="Privacy policy for the INVESThOuR website."
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">INVESThOuR</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        Information about how INVESThOuR handles website visitors and
        information collected through this site.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="content">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="article">

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how INVESThOuR ("we", "us" or
          "our") may collect, use and protect information when you visit
          this website.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>

        <p>
          INVESThOuR does not require you to create an account to browse
          the website. Depending on the features enabled on the site,
          certain information may be collected automatically, such as
          browser type, device information, approximate location,
          referring pages and pages visited.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>

        <p>
          We may use analytics services such as Google Analytics to
          understand how visitors use the website, including traffic
          sources, pages viewed and general usage patterns.
        </p>

        <p>
          Analytics providers may collect information using cookies,
          similar technologies or other identifiers. Their use of
          information is governed by their respective privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          The website may use cookies or similar technologies for
          functionality, analytics and performance measurement.
        </p>

        <p>
          You can generally control cookies through your browser settings.
          Disabling certain cookies may affect some website functionality.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>

        <p>
          INVESThOuR may contain links to third-party websites, including
          YouTube, X, LinkedIn and other services. We are not responsible
          for the privacy practices or content of external websites.
        </p>

        <h2>YouTube content</h2>

        <p>
          Some pages may embed videos hosted by YouTube. When you interact
          with an embedded YouTube player, YouTube may collect information
          according to its own privacy practices and policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Information you voluntarily provide</h2>

        <p>
          If the website later includes features such as contact forms,
          newsletters or other submission mechanisms, information you
          voluntarily provide may be collected for the purpose described
          at the time of submission.
        </p>

        <h2>How information may be used</h2>

        <p>
          Information may be used to operate, maintain, improve and
          understand the website, monitor performance, respond to
          communications and develop new content or features.
        </p>

        <h2>Data security</h2>

        <p>
          We take reasonable measures to protect information associated
          with the website. However, no method of transmission or storage
          over the internet can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's privacy</h2>

        <p>
          INVESThOuR is not intended to knowingly collect personal
          information from children. If you believe that a child has
          provided personal information through the website, please
          contact us so appropriate action can be considered.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Any
          changes will be reflected on this page.
        </p>

        <p class="updated">
          Last updated: August 18, 2026
        </p>

      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: 80px 0 60px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .page-header p:last-child {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .content {
    padding: 70px 0 100px;
  }

  .article {
    max-width: 800px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .article h2 {
    margin: 50px 0 14px;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .article p {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .article .updated {
    margin-top: 50px;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>